{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>The days of recompense have come</b> — that HaShem will repay you, you who used to say of the prophet of HaShem that he is a fool. And a man in whom the spirit of HaShem is, he is mad." "<b>Because your iniquity is great, hostility</b> — that is in every person's heart."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:40.479574251Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}